{"3880640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Katana", "steam_appid": 3880640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana — The Ultimate Clicker Game for Sword Enthusiasts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click. Collect. Repeat.<br>In <i>Katana</i>, every click brings you closer to building the greatest katana collection ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get a random katana every 3 hours</strong> and watch your collection grow with unique blades forged through community creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Hour Drop Rates*</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common – 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon – 16%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare – 3%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic – 0.99%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary – 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Drop rates are subject to change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A katana. Obviously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items to boost and expand your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A community fully powered by katana passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit your own designs via Discord!<br>Every katana in the game is inspired or created by players like you. Join the fun, leave your mark, and shape the future of <i>Katana</i>!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana — The Ultimate Clicker Game for Sword Enthusiasts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click. Collect. Repeat.<br>In <i>Katana</i>, every click brings you closer to building the greatest katana collection ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get a random katana every 3 hours</strong> and watch your collection grow with unique blades forged through community creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Hour Drop Rates*</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common – 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon – 16%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare – 3%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic – 0.99%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary – 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Drop rates are subject to change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A katana. Obviously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items to boost and expand your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A community fully powered by katana passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit your own designs via Discord!<br>Every katana in the game is inspired or created by players like you. Join the fun, leave your mark, and shape the future of <i>Katana</i>!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Katana is a clicker game where you click... a katana! Click the katana to earn more katanas — simple, addictive, and ever-growing. Every 3 hours, you’ll receive a random katana drop to add to your collection.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880640/20a82741881a381f7a7d02c5fcaafa85d10dc928/header.jpg?t=1754258562", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880640/39ea704eb09738e3382bf5134c94144a83971c06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754258562", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880640/39ea704eb09738e3382bf5134c94144a83971c06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754258562", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processo